// Title: Suspicious Reconnaissance Activity Using Get-LocalGroupMember Cmdlet
// ID: c8a180d6-47a3-4345-a609-53f9c3d834fc
// Status: test
// Level: medium
// Author: Nasreddine Bencherchali (Nextron Systems)
// Date: 2022-10-10
// Tags: attack.discovery, attack.t1087.001
// Description: Detects suspicious reconnaissance command line activity on Windows systems using the PowerShell Get-LocalGroupMember Cmdlet
// Converted by: Sigma Universal SIEM/EDR CLI

_sourceCategory=* | where ((CommandLine matches "*Get-LocalGroupMember *") and ((CommandLine matches "*domain admins*" or CommandLine matches "* administrator*" or CommandLine matches "* administrateur*" or CommandLine matches "*enterprise admins*" or CommandLine matches "*Exchange Trusted Subsystem*" or CommandLine matches "*Remote Desktop Users*" or CommandLine matches "*Utilisateurs du Bureau à distance*" or CommandLine matches "*Usuarios de escritorio remoto*")))
